# Keep build outputs out of the build context. The Dockerfile's `COPY . .`
# would otherwise copy them into the build stage, so each per-platform build
# in `make xpkg-build-multiarch` would upload the previous platform's
# controller tarball and xpkg, and miss the layer cache of the release's
# controller image build. `.git` changes on every git command and would bust
# that cache too; the build image has no git, so Go never stamps VCS info.
.git/
_output/
bin/
*.xpkg
